@b <https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/config-studio/legalruleml-mapping#>
@p lrmlmm=<http://docs.oasis-open.org/legalruleml/ns/v1.0/metamodel#>
@p rulemm=<http://docs.oasis-open.org/legalruleml/ns/v1.0/rule-metamodel#>
@p vocab=<http://docs.oasis-open.org/legalruleml/ns/v1.0/vocab#>
@p ins=<https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/instrument#>
@p pty=<https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/party#>
@p elg=<https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/eligibility#>
%R Lrml fm mork:RDF lb "LegalRuleML metamodel instances"
%X
lrmlmm:Obligation RE
lrmlmm:Prohibition RE
lrmlmm:Permission RE
lrmlmm:Right RE
lrmlmm:Reparation RE
lrmlmm:TemporalCharacteristic RE
lrmlmm:LegalReference RE
lrmlmm:Authority RE
lrmlmm:Jurisdiction RE
%T Concepts in Lrml
ObligationConcept C ra lrmlmm:Obligation
ProhibitionConcept C ra lrmlmm:Prohibition
PermissionConcept C ra lrmlmm:Permission
RightConcept C ra lrmlmm:Right
ReparationConcept C ra lrmlmm:Reparation
TemporalConcept C ra lrmlmm:TemporalCharacteristic
ReferenceConcept C ra lrmlmm:LegalReference
AuthorityConcept C ra lrmlmm:Authority
JurisdictionConcept C ra lrmlmm:Jurisdiction
BearerConcept C p lrmlmm:Bearer
AuxiliaryConcept C p lrmlmm:AuxiliaryParty
%M Scheme md mork:ReviewMode lb "LegalRuleML metamodel instances to stated meaning"
Role_T MD xt pty:Role c role
Role_T_Label M cb Role_T xr rdfs:label r "rdfs:label|rulemm:symbolForData"
# obligation
Obligation MD f ObligationConcept xt ins:Term,ins:Template c term w 85
Obligation_Relation MD cb Obligation xt ins:Obligation,ins:Template xr ins:arisesUnder c relation w 85
Obligation_Obligor MD cb Obligation_Relation tp Role_T f BearerConcept xi ins:obligor w 85
Obligation_Obligee MD cb Obligation_Relation tp Role_T f AuxiliaryConcept xi ins:obligee w 55 n "The auxiliary party is related to the specification, and is the party owed it only by assumption."
# prohibition
Prohibition MD f ProhibitionConcept xt ins:Term,ins:Template c term w 85
Prohibition_Relation MD cb Prohibition xt ins:Prohibition,ins:Template xr ins:arisesUnder c relation w 85
Prohibition_Obligor MD cb Prohibition_Relation tp Role_T f BearerConcept xi ins:obligor w 85
Prohibition_Obligee MD cb Prohibition_Relation tp Role_T f AuxiliaryConcept xi ins:obligee w 55
# permission
Permission MD f PermissionConcept xt ins:Term,ins:Template c term w 85
Permission_Relation MD cb Permission xt ins:Permission,ins:Template xr ins:arisesUnder c relation w 85
Permission_Holder MD cb Permission_Relation tp Role_T f BearerConcept xi ins:holder w 85
Permission_Counterparty MD cb Permission_Relation tp Role_T f AuxiliaryConcept xi ins:counterparty w 60
# right
Right MD f RightConcept xt ins:Term,ins:Template c term w 70
Right_Relation MD cb Right xt ins:Permission,ins:Template xr ins:arisesUnder c relation w 60 n "A Right is a permission that implies obligations or prohibitions on the auxiliary parties, which this mapping does not state."
Right_Holder MD cb Right_Relation tp Role_T f BearerConcept xi ins:holder w 80
Right_Counterparty MD cb Right_Relation tp Role_T f AuxiliaryConcept xi ins:counterparty w 65
# reparation
Reparation MD f ReparationConcept xt ins:Term,ins:Template c reparation-term w 55
Reparation_Relation MD cb Reparation xt ins:Obligation,ins:Template xr ins:arisesUnder c reparation w 45 n "A reparation links a penalty statement to a prescriptive statement, so it is the obligation arising on breach of the specification that statement entails."
Reparation_Breach M cb Reparation_Relation xr ins:arisesOnBreachOf r "lrmlmm:toPrescriptiveStatement" w 30 n "The statement is not the obligation. Its deontic specification is not reachable through the metamodel's properties, so a reviewer must complete the link."
Reparation_Penalty M cb Reparation_Relation xr ins:expressedIn r "lrmlmm:appliesPenalty" w 30 n "The penalty statement's text is held in its template, so the statement stands for the text."
# temporal characteristic
Temporal MD f TemporalConcept xt fnd:TemporalScope c temporal-scope w 35
Temporal_From M cb Temporal xr fnd:validFrom r "lrmlmm:atTime/rulemm:symbolForData" w 35 mork:appliesWhen Starts_Shape
Temporal_To M cb Temporal xr fnd:validTo r "lrmlmm:atTime/rulemm:symbolForData" w 35 mork:appliesWhen Ends_Shape
# legal source
Reference MD f ReferenceConcept xt fnd:Key c key w 40
Reference_Value M cb Reference xr fnd:keyValue r lrmlmm:refID w 55
# authority and jurisdiction
Authority MD f AuthorityConcept xt pty:Actor c authority w 40
Jurisdiction MD f JurisdictionConcept xt skos:Concept c jurisdiction w 20
!T Scheme sh:declare _:d1
!T _:d1 sh:prefix "lrmlmm"
!T _:d1 sh:namespace "http://docs.oasis-open.org/legalruleml/ns/v1.0/metamodel#"^xsd:anyURI
!T Scheme sh:declare _:d2
!T _:d2 sh:prefix "rulemm"
!T _:d2 sh:namespace "http://docs.oasis-open.org/legalruleml/ns/v1.0/rule-metamodel#"^xsd:anyURI
!T Scheme sh:declare _:d3
!T _:d3 sh:prefix "rdfs"
!T _:d3 sh:namespace "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#"^xsd:anyURI
!T Starts_Shape rdf:type sh:NodeShape
!T Starts_Shape sh:property _:s1
!T _:s1 sh:path lrmlmm:hasStatusDevelopment
!T _:s1 sh:hasValue vocab:Starts
!T Ends_Shape rdf:type sh:NodeShape
!T Ends_Shape sh:property _:e1
!T _:e1 sh:path lrmlmm:hasStatusDevelopment
!T _:e1 sh:hasValue vocab:Ends
